# RealDoor — API Reference

All routes are mounted under `/api` by the Express router in `artifacts/api-server/src/routes/index.ts`.

**Contract status.** `lib/api-spec/openapi.yaml` is the source of truth for the *housing* routes and is what Orval generates from. The copilot, LIHTC, HUD and translate surfaces were built past the spec and are documented here only. Bringing them into the spec is tracked as open work.

---

## Health

### `GET /api/healthz`

Liveness probe. Returns a status payload.

