## Housing

Data is served from hardcoded frozen constants in `src/lib/housingData.ts`. No database.

### `GET /api/fmr`

Fair Market Rent for a borough.

| Param | In | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `borough` | query | enum | NYC borough |

### `GET /api/ami`

Area Median Income figures for a borough.

| Param | In | Type |
|---|---|---|
| `borough` | query | enum |

### `GET /api/listings`

Affordable housing listings, optionally filtered by borough.

| Param | In | Type |
|---|---|---|
| `borough` | query | enum (optional) |

### `POST /api/eligibility`

Computes rent burden and compares against FMR and AMI for the household.

Request body carries income, rent, household size, and borough. Returns a burden status, comparison figures, and program matches.

### `GET /api/programs`

The full assistance-program catalog with plain-language descriptions and application links.

