## HUD (live, supplemental)

Proxied through `src/lib/hudClient.ts`. **Supplemental context only** — clearly labeled in the UI and never used for any scored computation.

### `GET /api/hud/fmr`

Live Fair Market Rent lookup.

### `GET /api/hud/il`

Live Income Limits lookup.

